04. Where does DevOps come into VPC?

This is where VPC becomes extremely important for your career.

Suppose you have:

Developer
    |
    v
GitHub
    |
    v
Jenkins
    |
    v
Docker Build
    |
    v
ECR
    |
    v
EKS
    |
    v
ALB
    |
    v
Users

Networking may look like:

                    GitHub
                       |
                       v
                    Jenkins
                       |
                       v
                    AWS ECR
                       |
                       v
              +----------------+
              |      VPC       |
              |                |
              |   ALB          |
              |    |           |
              |    v           |
              |  EKS           |
              |    |           |
              |    v           |
              |   RDS          |
              +----------------+

Now you need to understand:

Which subnet?
Which route table?
Which security group?
Internet or private connectivity?
NAT required?
VPC endpoint required?
Which AZ?
Public or private EKS nodes?
How does ALB reach pods?
How does EKS pull images from ECR?
How does the application reach RDS?

That's DevOps networking.
